    "NON-OHKO KO by a KING'S ROCK holder (EARTHQUAKE vs MAGNETON, 4x weak): draws at frames 72/73/76 (accuracy, crit, damage roll) plus the moveend King's Rock draw at frame 642; gBattleMoveDamage = 264 against a 125 HP target, physicalDmg = 125, targetHp = 0.",
    "NON-KO hit by the same holder (EARTHQUAKE vs METAPOD, 125 -> 76): same three hit-chain draws plus the moveend King's Rock draw at frame 299. KO and non-KO behave identically at state 12.",
    "gSpecialStatuses[target].shellBellDmg survives the faint into state 12 on the KO arm (125), so a KO does not suppress Shell Bell.",
    "Cmd_resultmessage clears gMoveResultFlags: the OHKO arm's flags go 20 -> 0 at frame 271, so `!(gMoveResultFlags & MOVE_RESULT_NO_EFFECT)` is TRUE at moveend, not false.",
